<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<ContentPage xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/dotnet/2021/maui"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2009/xaml"
             x:Class="SBSBeautySpa.Mobile.Views.AboutPage"
             Shell.NavBarIsVisible="False">

    <!-- Main layout -->
    <Grid RowDefinitions="Auto,*" Padding="20,50,20,16"
          Background="{StaticResource PageGradient}">

        <!-- Header: Back arrow + page title -->
        <Grid Grid.Row="0" ColumnDefinitions="Auto,*" ColumnSpacing="14">
            <!-- Back arrow; tapping it triggers OnBackTapped -->
            <Label Text="←" FontSize="28" TextColor="White" VerticalOptions="Center">
                <Label.GestureRecognizers>
                    <TapGestureRecognizer Tapped="OnBackTapped" />
                </Label.GestureRecognizers>
            </Label>
            <!-- Page title -->
            <Label Grid.Column="1" Text="About" Style="{StaticResource PageTitle}" />
        </Grid>

        <!-- Scrollable content area -->
        <ScrollView Grid.Row="1" Margin="0,24,0,0">
            <VerticalStackLayout Spacing="10">

                <!-- ABOUT THE APP section -->
                <Label Text="ABOUT THE APP" Style="{StaticResource CapsLabel}" />
                <Border Style="{StaticResource GroupCard}">
                    <VerticalStackLayout Padding="14,12" Spacing="6">
                        <!-- Short description of what the app offers -->
                        <Label Text="Your services, in one place" Style="{StaticResource RowTitle}" />
                        <Label Style="{StaticResource LegalBody}">
                            Browse services, make and manage bookings, explore the shop and view the gallery. Keep your profile, payment methods and notification preferences together in your account.
                        </Label>
                    </VerticalStackLayout>
                </Border>

                <!-- LEGAL section header -->
                <Label Text="LEGAL" Style="{StaticResource CapsLabel}" Margin="0,10,0,0" />

                <!-- TERMS AND CONDITIONS card -->
                <Border Style="{StaticResource GroupCard}">
                    <VerticalStackLayout Padding="16,16" Spacing="8">
                        <Label Text="Terms and conditions" Style="{StaticResource LegalHeading}" />

                        <!-- PASTE YOUR TERMS HERE: one Label per paragraph -->
                        <Label Style="{StaticResource LegalBody}">
                            Last Updated: [10/10/2026]
                        1. Introduction
                        Welcome to SBS Beauty Spa! Our app allows you to browse beauty services and products, book appointments, make payments and manage your bookings. By using the app, you agree to these Terms and Conditions.
                        </Label>
                        <Label Style="{StaticResource LegalBody}">
                            2. User Accounts
                            Users must provide accurate information when creating an account and keep their login details secure. Users may not access other people's accounts or use the app for unlawful activities.
                        </Label>

                        <Label Style="{StaticResource LegalBody}">
                            3. User Roles
                        The app has three user roles:
                        • Client/User: Can manage their profile, book appointments, make payments and view booking history.
                        • Admin/Employee: Can manage appointments, availability and relevant client information.
                        • Super Admin: The business owner, with access to employee management, user management, business reports and important settings. This account cannot be created by ordinary users or employees.
                        </Label>

                        <Label Style="{StaticResource LegalBody}">
                            4. Bookings and Cancellations
                            Clients are responsible for selecting the correct service, date and time. Appointments are confirmed once the app or SBS Beauty Spa confirms the booking.
                            Please arrive on time and notify us if you need to cancel or reschedule. Any cancellation deadlines or charges will be communicated before booking. If we need to cancel an appointment, we will notify you as soon as reasonably possible.
                        </Label>

                        <Label Style="{StaticResource LegalBody}">
                            5. Payments and Refunds
                            Service and product prices will be communicated before payment. Some appointments may require a deposit, and any applicable conditions will be explained before booking.
                            Refunds, cancellations and payment disputes will be handled fairly and in accordance with our applicable policies and South African law.
                        </Label>

                        <Label Style="{StaticResource LegalBody}">
                            6. Services and Products
                            Clients should inform us of relevant allergies or sensitivities before a beauty treatment. Nail designs shown in the app are examples, and final results may vary.
                            For product orders, clients must provide correct delivery details. Delivery times may vary when third-party couriers are used. Please contact us if an order is missing, damaged or incorrect.
                        </Label>

                        <Label Style="{StaticResource LegalBody}">
                            7. Notifications and Privacy
                            We may send booking confirmations, reminders, payment updates and order notifications through the app or email.
                            We collect personal information needed to manage accounts, appointments, payments and orders. We take reasonable steps to protect this information and handle it in accordance with South African privacy laws, including POPIA. Please also read our Privacy Policy.
                        </Label>
                        
                        <Label Style="{StaticResource LegalBody}">
                          8. Acceptable Use
                         Users must not misuse the app, access restricted information or interfere with its security. We may restrict accounts involved in fraud, unauthorised access or serious misuse where reasonably necessary.
                        We aim to keep the app available but cannot guarantee uninterrupted service.
                        </Label>

                        <Label Style="{StaticResource LegalBody}">
                            9. Changes to These Terms
                            SBS Beauty Spa may update these Terms and Conditions when necessary. Updated terms will be made available through the app, with the date of the latest update.
                        </Label>
                        
                        <Label Style="{StaticResource LegalBody}">
                            10. Governing Law
                        These Terms and Conditions are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa. Clients may contact us directly to resolve any concerns or complaints.
                        </Label>

                        <Label Style="{StaticResource LegalBody}">
                            12. Acceptance
                        By creating an account or accepting these terms in the app, you confirm that you have read and agree to these Terms and Conditions, subject to your rights under applicable law.
                        </Label>


                    </VerticalStackLayout>
                </Border>

                

            </VerticalStackLayout>
        </ScrollView>
    </Grid>
</ContentPage>